OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed for abusing vulnerable
OL,4,Agirl in 2000s                          
OL,6,FA fourth man, Khurram Iqbal, 40, was   
OL,7,Fhanded a nine-month suspended sentence,
OL,8,Fwhich the judge said was partly on     
OL,9,Faccount of the fact he was 16 at the   
OL,10,Ftime of the offences.                  
